Greetings, <%= @business %>

<% if @has_product_target %>
Your coupon for <%= @product_name %> has expired.
<% if @has_active_subscription %>
Your subscription will now be billed at the regular price of <%= @subscription_price %>/<%= @billing_cycle %>.
<% else %>
You don't currently have an active <%= @product_name %> subscription, so nothing will be charged.
<% end %>

You can manage your subscriptions from your billing page: <%= @licensing_url %>
<% else %>
We're sorry to say that your coupon for <%= branded_plan_name(GitHub::Plan.business_plus).titleize %> has expired.
<% end %>
<% if @education_coupon %>
If you are still a student or teacher, you may apply for a new academic discount coupon at https://education.github.com.
<% end %>

<% unless @has_product_target %>
<% if @payment_method_on_file %>
Your GitHub Enterprise subscription will renew automatically using the payment method on file. You can review your payment method here: <%= @payment_settings_url %>
<% else %>
If you'd like to renew GitHub, please update your payment method here: <%= @payment_settings_url %>

Your enterprise account has been restricted, but will still provide access to your private repositories. If you would like to downgrade, then follow these documented steps to proceed: <%= @downgrade_url %>.
<% end %>
<% end %>

If you feel there's been a mistake or have any questions, visit <%= contact_url %>

Thanks,
The GitHub Team
